Greetings,

Thank you for your email.  I=E2=80=99ve peaked inside the renovated units a=
nd they
do look nice but I=E2=80=99m not interested in renovations in the suite I o=
ccupy.

I would like you to confirm that a lease renewal agreement is being sent to
me to sign as per my conversation with a myplace realty representative last
week.

In regards to Eden, the cleaning schedule of the space has declined
noticeably since the departure of Jardel, the previous caretaker. I would
appreciate if you can inform me what sort of schedule you expect your
employees to maintain; including vacuuming, which appears to have not
occurred for several weeks time.

All the best! I hope that you and your family are doing well.

Sincerely,
Evan Rosner



